{"parse": {"title": "打虎记-08", "pageid": 134672, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-07\" title=\"打虎记-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">打虎记-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">打虎记</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.99.BD.E5.B1.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"白屋\">白屋</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 白屋</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Cage</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>走廊远处的某扇门被人合上，隔绝了模糊不清的交谈声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间内的故事结束，四百年后的听众挠了挠脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>之后，你便回祝县做了巡检？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……因为一些原因，那年，我没有当上巡检。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我把铁梭子交给厉晦锋，他也只是笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>可我遇着你的时候，你似乎已经做了好久巡检——抓人，吆喝人，可熟练了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>是我运气好。三年后，另一处巡检司又有了空缺，我便填了进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>所以这就是匣子的由来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个精致的木匣子躺在房中央的木桌上。木盒的盖子已经被打开，放于一旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>木盒里是一张薄薄的会票，书着京师胡家，款目是白银万两。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另有写明：<br />付与秀郎中，赠与程和光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>有趣。东亚分部的人只告诉我，他们仓库里有件躺了几百年的老文物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>据说是个大家族——胡家托付的，指明要交给一个叫程和光的人，此人还必须有名为“锐意”的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>上哪儿找这么个人？在我们出梅树之前，他们都忘了有这件东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我也从未听说有这么一件物事。之后发生了太多事……我没有再去过水乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哎——这么多钱，若你还在涣州，荣华富贵都不愁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>可如今世事更易，胡家早就不在了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昂贵的会票如今只是废纸一张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>她为何要给你这么多钱呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这点，我应该永远无法知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪不知想到了什么，忽然笑了笑。她踱了两圈，最后走到门边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>长辈……或许就是希望你一生顺遂吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>东西既带到了，小道我也先告辞了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间里只剩下程和光一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>要走了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光收拾好包袱，点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>既然可以交差了，我便尽快回去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>这是一瓶缓解咳疾的药，拿上再走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你放过我，我很意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我以为……你至少会因为程小弟的事情恨我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那是他的选择，他有责任承担后果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……有时候我想，或许你更像我们这些贼子，而不是那些老爷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光把药收进囊中，停顿了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不。若你再回去做盗匪，我绝不会留情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……只是不论本心如何，事情已经发生，所有人也付出了代价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你做郎中，我做巡检，这样更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>这件事与你无关，这不是你的错。你那程姓的宗族，也不过是些远亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这点我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>或许你嫌我啰嗦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你为何不在水乡做个打虎英雄？为何一定要回去受那些白眼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>打虎的确很痛快……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那又如何？他不是独身一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他在祝县有一栋漂亮的白房子，房子里住着他的亲人。他是程家的孩子，必须守好这栋白房子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在墙重新刷为纯白之前……他怎能离开？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>但我终究只会是贼子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>官贼只是名分而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不仅仅是名分。还是武学的门槛，碎银子，以及……救命的药材。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>乐殊贵贱，礼别尊卑。外受傅训，入奉母仪。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>县里的人都崇敬圣贤书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><i>仁慈隐恻，造次弗离。节义廉退，颠沛匪亏。</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但书里没有打虎的侠客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……大义需在正道上实现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你放心，我若是做了巡检，一定会做正确、公正的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>如果我来节制民兵，绝不会放任那老虎肆虐那么久，更不会死了三个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……我也不会放任那些流民饿死，这样一切便不会发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>那你要做到将军才行了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>做了巡检，日后便有机会做百户，做千户，自然也有机会做将军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>口气挺大，只怕世情不像你想的一般——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中截住了话头，摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>但若能富贵一生也好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她落寞地笑了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>当官的房子都可漂亮了，你爹娘或许也盼着这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>可若有一天出了事，记得回来找我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我会帮你。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Cg-3_4_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>祝县城内仍与走前一样。街道摆满了漂亮的屋子，青瓦一间压着一间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……官贼只是名分吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>走了这么多天，不知道家里如何……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>穿过三道牌坊，程和光看见了自家房屋的飞檐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313723.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313723.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313723.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313723.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313723.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313723.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313723.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313723.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_4_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_4_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_4_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>那年我本想把房子卖了，攒些钱。愿意来看的人都恭维说，真是一间好院子，真是一间漂亮的房子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>好房不露财，不知道里面是堆满了金银珠宝，还是绫罗绸缎？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>咳……他们满怀艳羡地进了门，最后却唉声叹气地出了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>因为我们的房子里一无所有……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644503.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644503.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-644503.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644503.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>因为墓是死人的屋子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-647402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-647402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/HeadIconSmall-647402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>而屋子是活人的坟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这老屋曾送走过无数主人，如今也只是更添了一位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长长的白幡在风中飘动，扫乱了地面的红梅。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuibangongshi\"><img alt=\"jijinhuibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一阵狂风吹入屋内，卷走了那张薄薄的会票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>在一个错误的地方谋求胜利，最终徒增的，只有错误罢了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会票飘出窗外，如飞鸟一般越飞越高，越飞越远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直至超出他的神秘术可感知的范围，直至凝为远处一个几乎不可见的白点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一位朋友去而复返，在门口探出头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哎呀，瞧我这记性，另有件事我忘说了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我在东亚分部遇着了夜巡局的人，他们想拉你入伙呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>夜巡局你知道么？做的事和巡检差不多，抓贼、写报告之类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-314101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我只顺手带个话，你意下如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光看着空空如也的匣子，微不可见地笑了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>之后再说吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_08\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_08\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0b/Cg-3_4_bg_08.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_08.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他想起了一栋老屋，一间白房子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_07.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_07\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_07\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_4_bg_07.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_4_bg_07.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-3_4_bg_07.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间迎接人们出生的房子，一间欢送人们死去的房子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间埋葬了父亲、母亲和朋友的房子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间轮廓分明、方正森严的房子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_021_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_021_zone\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_021_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/Cg-3_4_at_021_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_021_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"880\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/da/Cg-3_4_at_021_zone.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"736\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_06\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/Cg-3_4_bg_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间被烈火焚烧的房子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>路在门外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-313722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-313722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-313722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我已经烧了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "打虎记-08"}}